{"id":1839060,"shortDescription":"Polylithic es un juego de supervivencia único, en el momento más decisivo de la historia humana. Vive como cazador-recolector del Paleolítico, asiéntate como agricultor del Neolítico, forma tribus en co-op o ve en solitario a un mundo donde el depredador dominante es aún una aspiración lejana.","developers":["polyperfect"],"publishers":["indie.io"],"categories":["Un jugador","Multijugador","Cooperativo","Cooperativo en línea","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Compatible con DualShock","Compatible con DualSense","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"25 AGO 2026","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1793823381","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839060/94978464ee490d70ee00de39312ac50eb9533e2c/ss_94978464ee490d70ee00de39312ac50eb9533e2c.600x338.jpg?t=1793823381","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839060/94978464ee490d70ee00de39312ac50eb9533e2c/ss_94978464ee490d70ee00de39312ac50eb9533e2c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793823381"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839060/30bb7114e8284bff50b2cb3b0a8723bc388c0740/ss_30bb7114e8284bff50b2cb3b0a8723bc388c0740.600x338.jpg?t=1793823381","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839060/30bb7114e8284bff50b2cb3b0a8723bc388c0740/ss_30bb7114e8284bff50b2cb3b0a8723bc388c0740.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793823381"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839060/ebe16de623e63ad116189505d6fa236fb5576b3c/ss_ebe16de623e63ad116189505d6fa236fb5576b3c.600x338.jpg?t=1793823381","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839060/ebe16de623e63ad116189505d6fa236fb5576b3c/ss_ebe16de623e63ad116189505d6fa236fb5576b3c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793823381"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_